{
  "uid": "portal5-model-management",
  "title": "Portal 5 \u2014 Model Management (Load Guard)",
  "tags": [
    "portal5",
    "load-guard",
    "models"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "5m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "description": "What the pipeline's load guard decided: cold-load admissions, the wait each one spent, the evictions it issued, and the headroom it measured against oMLX's ceiling. Colour directions: green = admitted without waiting / headroom healthy, amber = waited, an eviction, or the ceiling itself, red = refused. Sources: portal5_load_guard_* on the pipeline's /metrics (portal/platform/inference/load_guard.py).",
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 100,
      "title": "Admissions and refusals",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Cold-load admissions by outcome",
      "description": "Admission decisions per engine. admitted_immediately fit on the first measure; admitted_after_wait queued for memory or the cold-load lock; refused is the HTTP 507 count. A rising refused share with flat admissions is the P5-LOADGUARD-SWAP-001 shape.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (engine, outcome) (rate(portal5_load_guard_admissions_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{engine}} \u00b7 {{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisLabel": "admissions/s"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*admitted_immediately"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#199e70"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*admitted_after_wait"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#c98500"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*refused"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Refusal reasons",
      "description": "Why admission gave up. quiet: host settled, the projection exceeds headroom, nothing in flight to wait for. projected-exceeds: waited for in-flight work and it still does not fit. transition-active: an engine model swap outlived the wait. deadline: the cold-load lock never freed. quiet spikes on a host that should be busy are worth an incident note (P5-LOADGUARD-SWAP-001).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (engine, reason) (rate(portal5_load_guard_refusals_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{engine}} \u00b7 {{reason}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "red"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisLabel": "refusals/s"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 101,
      "title": "Waits, evictions and capacity",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Admission wait p50 / p95",
      "description": "Seconds cold loads spent inside admission (X-Portal-Load-Wait spent waiting for memory, swaps or the lock), admitted or refused. p50 near zero with a fat p95 means a few loads are soaking the whole wait budget.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(portal5_load_guard_wait_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(portal5_load_guard_wait_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisLabel": "wait seconds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "p50"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#199e70"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "p95"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#c98500"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Unloads the guard issued",
      "description": "Evictions by engine and reason: idle_ollama (keep_alive 0 on an idle resident), idle_omlx (admin unload of an idle oMLX model), queued_202 (oMLX accepted the unload asynchronously). Each one is a cold reload waiting for whoever asks for that model next.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (engine, reason) (rate(portal5_load_guard_unloads_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{engine}} \u00b7 {{reason}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#c98500"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisLabel": "unloads/s"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Headroom at decision vs oMLX ceiling",
      "description": "portal5_load_guard_headroom_bytes is the budget the last admission decided against (ceiling - oMLX residents + idle Ollama - margin); portal5_load_guard_ceiling_bytes is oMLX's live final_ceiling. A ceiling that saws overnight is P5-OMLX-CEILING-001 (balanced tier follows free memory); headroom pinned near zero explains any refusal in the panels above.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(portal5_load_guard_headroom_bytes)",
          "legendFormat": "headroom at decision"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "max(portal5_load_guard_ceiling_bytes)",
          "legendFormat": "oMLX final_ceiling"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisLabel": "bytes"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "headroom at decision"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#199e70"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "oMLX final_ceiling"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#c98500"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
